{
    "title": "Adventure Escape Mysteries",
    "description": "Play a story-driven room escape game with unique puzzles enjoyed by tens of millions of players. Solve mysteries, puzzle through escape rooms, and find the clue that will crack the case in a critically acclaimed puzzle adventure game!\r\n\r\n<h2>SOLVE A MURDER MYSTERY</h2>\r\nFind clues and solve a murder mystery as Detective Kate Gray in On Thin Ice! A mysterious criminal has blackmailed the police station and a key witness was murdered. Investigate the crime scene, interrogate suspects, and solve the case. \r\n\r\n<h2>SURVIVE THE HORROR</h2>\r\nJulian Torres is an ordinary boy in a sleepy town until a creepy serial killer known as Mirror Man tries to kill him. Julian must escape haunted houses, scary situations, and his own creepy memories. Who is Mirror Man? What can stop him? Can you help Julian survive? This is a scary puzzle game for adults!\r\n\r\n<h2>PLAY AN EPIC STORY</h2>\r\nSave a fantasy kingdom in Legend of the Sacred Stones! A mysterious curse has fallen over Tempus Island. Help Aila take control of the elements, escape brain teasing temples, and battle towering Stone Gods in this epic adventure!\r\n\r\n<h2>SOLVE UNIQUE PUZZLES</h2>\r\nTrain your mind. Use your observation skills, deductive reasoning, and cunning to solve our logic puzzles and brain teasers. Collect treasures and tools in your inventory, find clues, and relax and enjoy an escape room game from the comfort of your mobile device.\r\n\r\n<h2>ENTIRELY FREE</h2>\r\nPlay for free! You can support Haiku by purchasing a hint if you\u2019re stuck, but you\u2019re never forced to. And no - we don\u2019t create impossible puzzles so you\u2019re forced to pay. The escape rooms may be challenging but the puzzles are always solvable!\r\n\r\n<h2>INSPIRED BY CLASSIC POINT AND CLICK GAMES</h2>\r\nAdventure Escape takes the best of classic point and click adventure games that adults love and mixes it with the brain teasing gameplay of modern escape games.\r\n\r\n<h2>RAVE REVIEWS</h2>\r\nAdventure Escape has been played by tens of millions of players and has a >4.5 star average rating. Game critics like AppPicker, TechWiser, AndroidAuthority, and AppUnwrapper have picked Adventure Escape games as the best escape room game.\r\n\r\n<h2>SUPPORT AN INDIE GAME COMPANY</h2>\r\nWe're an indie game studio that loves riddles, logic puzzles, and brain teasers. Our team has been to hundreds of escape rooms and participated in jigsaw puzzle competitions. At Haiku, we have a game design philosophy we call \u201csatisfying challenge.\u201d We think puzzles should be tough but solvable, so we spend a lot of time designing unique escape room gameplay that we think you'll love!\r\n\r\nWebsite: www.haikugames.com\r\nFacebook: www.facebook.com/adventureescape\r\nInstagram: www.instagram.com/haikugamesco\r\n\r\n<h2>KEY FEATURES</h2>\r\n  Influence the story's direction with your choices.\r\n  Enjoy the entire escape game experience for free!\r\n  Engage in ingenious escape room gameplay, investigating environments and interpreting clues to solve puzzles!\r\n  Explore over 500 beautifully illustrated scenes.\r\n  Encounter challenging puzzles for adults that tease your brain\r\n  Seamlessly continue your progress across multiple devices.\r\n  Regularly updated with more fun stories!\r\n  Play offline by downloading chapters in advance! No wifi required.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Play a story-driven room escape game with unique puzzles enjoyed by tens of millions of players. Solve mysteries, puzzle through escape rooms, and find the clue that will crack the case in a critically acclaimed puzzle adventure game!<br><br><h2>SOLVE A MURDER MYSTERY</h2><br>Find clues and solve a murder mystery as Detective Kate Gray in On Thin Ice! A mysterious criminal has blackmailed the police station and a key witness was murdered. Investigate the crime scene, interrogate suspects, and solve the case. <br><br><h2>SURVIVE THE HORROR</h2><br>Julian Torres is an ordinary boy in a sleepy town until a creepy serial killer known as Mirror Man tries to kill him. Julian must escape haunted houses, scary situations, and his own creepy memories. Who is Mirror Man? What can stop him? Can you help Julian survive? This is a scary puzzle game for adults!<br><br><h2>PLAY AN EPIC STORY</h2><br>Save a fantasy kingdom in Legend of the Sacred Stones! A mysterious curse has fallen over Tempus Island. Help Aila take control of the elements, escape brain teasing temples, and battle towering Stone Gods in this epic adventure!<br><br><h2>SOLVE UNIQUE PUZZLES</h2><br>Train your mind. Use your observation skills, deductive reasoning, and cunning to solve our logic puzzles and brain teasers. Collect treasures and tools in your inventory, find clues, and relax and enjoy an escape room game from the comfort of your mobile device.<br><br><h2>ENTIRELY FREE</h2><br>Play for free! You can support Haiku by purchasing a hint if you\u2019re stuck, but you\u2019re never forced to. And no - we don\u2019t create impossible puzzles so you\u2019re forced to pay. The escape rooms may be challenging but the puzzles are always solvable!<br><br><h2>INSPIRED BY CLASSIC POINT AND CLICK GAMES</h2><br>Adventure Escape takes the best of classic point and click adventure games that adults love and mixes it with the brain teasing gameplay of modern escape games.<br><br><h2>RAVE REVIEWS</h2><br>Adventure Escape has been played by tens of millions of players and has a &gt;4.5 star average rating. Game critics like AppPicker, TechWiser, AndroidAuthority, and AppUnwrapper have picked Adventure Escape games as the best escape room game.<br><br><h2>SUPPORT AN INDIE GAME COMPANY</h2><br>We&#39;re an indie game studio that loves riddles, logic puzzles, and brain teasers. Our team has been to hundreds of escape rooms and participated in jigsaw puzzle competitions. At Haiku, we have a game design philosophy we call \u201csatisfying challenge.\u201d We think puzzles should be tough but solvable, so we spend a lot of time designing unique escape room gameplay that we think you&#39;ll love!<br><br>Website: www.haikugames.com<br>Facebook: www.facebook.com/adventureescape<br>Instagram: www.instagram.com/haikugamesco<br><br><h2>KEY FEATURES</h2><br>  Influence the story&#39;s direction with your choices.<br>  Enjoy the entire escape game experience for free!<br>  Engage in ingenious escape room gameplay, investigating environments and interpreting clues to solve puzzles!<br>  Explore over 500 beautifully illustrated scenes.<br>  Encounter challenging puzzles for adults that tease your brain<br>  Seamlessly continue your progress across multiple devices.<br>  Regularly updated with more fun stories!<br>  Play offline by downloading chapters in advance! No wifi required.",
